{"id":"verlust","lemma":"Verlust","pos":"noun","rank":1838,"glosses":["loss (all senses, except defeat, for which Niederlage is used)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/53/De-at-Verlust.ogg/De-at-Verlust.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Verlustes","plural":"Verluste"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hörte von deinem Verlust.","en":"I heard about your loss.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Wir fühlen wegen deines Verlustes mit dir.","en":"We feel for your loss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756919","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to feel"},{"g":"for, because of"},{"g":"yours, thine","l":"deiner"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"}]},{"text":"Das ist ein schwerer Verlust.","en":"That's a bad loss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389318","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"heavy, weighty","l":"schwer"},null]},{"text":"Die Verluste sind unkalkulierbar.","en":"The losses are incalculable.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Was für ein Verlust!","en":"What a loss!","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]}]}